$S = \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot UE \cdot LI = \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot \dfrac{3R}{2} \cdot \dfrac{2R\sqrt{3}}{3} = \dfrac{R^{2}\sqrt{3}}{2}$.
