Suy ra\\
$VA = VH + HA = \dfrac{R\sqrt{3}}{2} + \dfrac{R\sqrt{3}}{6} = \dfrac{2R\sqrt{3}}{3}$.\\
Diện tích $\triangle {VMA}$ là\\
$S = \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot VA \cdot MH = \dfrac{1}{2} \cdot \dfrac{3R}{2} \cdot \dfrac{2R\sqrt{3}}{3} = \dfrac{R^{2}\sqrt{3}}{2}$.
}\end{ex}

